  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Capturing Lessons from UK supported WASH Programs in Nepal</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This is an evidence generation work aiming to provide FCDO and BEK with a comprehensive analysis of the past and ongoing investments in the Water Sanitation and Hygiene (WASH) Sector in Nepal to document learnings and recommend future strategy on WASH sector in Nepal.</narrative>
  </description>
